  "releaseNotes": "Initial stable release.\n\t\t\t- Redis Connection Factory\n\t\t\t- Distributed Lock Provider\n\t\t\t- Dependency Injection integration\n\t\t\t- Production-ready defaults\n\t\t\t1.0.4: Dependency refresh. StackExchange.Redis 2.13.1 to 2.13.17. No code or API changes.\n\t\t\t1.1.0: targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. No public API or behavior change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new, and the net8.0 asset is unchanged. Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions is declared per TFM (8.0.2 / 9.0.21 / 10.0.13), raising the floor on net9.0/net10.0.\n\t\t\t1.1.1: Documentation fix in the packed README. The component table no longer lists RedisConnectionFactory and RedisLockProvider, which are internal implementations. No code, API or dependency changes.",
